8
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,160
But I say to you

9
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:34,240
who hear, love your enemies.

10
00:03:34,940 --> 00:03:36,020
Do good to those who

11
00:03:36,020 --> 00:03:38,020
hate you. Bless those

12
00:03:38,020 --> 00:03:39,980
who curse you. Pray for those who

13
00:03:39,980 --> 00:03:42,040
abuse you. To one who strikes

14
00:03:42,040 --> 00:03:44,240
you on the cheek, offer the other also.

15
00:03:44,700 --> 00:03:46,060
And from one who takes away

16
00:03:46,060 --> 00:03:48,100
your cloak, do not withhold your tunic

17
00:03:48,100 --> 00:03:50,080
either. Give

18
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,860
to everyone who begs from you.

19
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:54,000
And from one who takes away your goods,

20
00:03:54,300 --> 00:03:55,600
do not demand them back.

21
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:58,120
And as you wish that others would do to

22
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:59,880
you, do so to

23
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:01,880
them. If you

24
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:03,860
love those who love you, what

25
00:04:03,860 --> 00:04:05,880
benefit is that to you? For even

26
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:07,500
sinners love those who love them.

27
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,840
And if you do good to those who do

28
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:12,040
good to you, what benefit is that

29
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:13,840
to you? For even sinners

30
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,820
do the same. And

31
00:04:15,820 --> 00:04:17,960
if you lend to those from whom you expect

32
00:04:17,960 --> 00:04:20,000
to receive, what credit is that

33
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,800
to you? Even sinners

34
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,900
lend to sinners to get back the same

35
00:04:23,900 --> 00:04:25,800
amount. But love

36
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:28,000
your enemies, and do good

37
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,840
and lend, expecting nothing

38
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:32,060
in return. And your reward

39
00:04:32,060 --> 00:04:33,940
will be great, and you will be

40
00:04:33,940 --> 00:04:35,480
sons of the Most High.

41
00:04:35,860 --> 00:04:37,980
For He is kind to the ungrateful

42
00:04:37,980 --> 00:04:39,260
and the evil.

43
00:04:40,140 --> 00:04:41,980
Be merciful, even

44
00:04:41,980 --> 00:04:43,420
as your Father is merciful.

45
00:04:44,220 --> 00:04:46,220
Judge not, and you will not be judged.

46
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:48,000
Condemn not, and you will

47
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,880
not be condemned. Forgive,

48
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,940
and you will be forgiven.

49
00:04:52,620 --> 00:04:54,040
Give, and it will be given to

50
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:56,020
you. Good measure, pressed

51
00:04:56,020 --> 00:04:58,240
down, shaken together, running over

52
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,620
will be put into your lap.

53
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:01,640
For with the measure you use,

54
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:03,940
it will be measured back to you.

55
00:05:04,620 --> 00:05:05,800
He also told them

56
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,860
a parable. Can a blind

57
00:05:07,860 --> 00:05:09,220
man lead a blind man?

58
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,740
Will they not both fall into a pit?

59
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:13,840
A disciple is not above his

60
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:15,860
teacher, but everyone when he is

61
00:05:15,860 --> 00:05:17,860
fully trained will be like his

62
00:05:17,860 --> 00:05:19,800
teacher. Why

63
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:22,080
do you see the speck that is in your brother's

64
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:24,060
eye, but do not notice the log

65
00:05:24,060 --> 00:05:25,140
that is in your own eye?

66
00:05:25,620 --> 00:05:27,460
How can you say to your brother,

67
00:05:27,460 --> 00:05:29,560
Brother, let me take out

68
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:31,680
the speck that is in your eye, when you

69
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:33,740
yourself do not see the log that is in

70
00:05:33,740 --> 00:05:36,220
your own eye? You hypocrite!

71
00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:37,540
First,

72
00:05:37,860 --> 00:05:39,760
take the log out of your own eye,

73
00:05:40,300 --> 00:05:41,840
and then you will see clearly

74
00:05:41,840 --> 00:05:43,660
to take out the speck that is in your

75
00:05:43,660 --> 00:05:44,340
brother's eye.

76
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:47,620
For no good tree bears bad fruit,

77
00:05:47,860 --> 00:05:49,840
nor again does a bad tree bear good

78
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:51,820
fruit. For each tree is known

79
00:05:51,820 --> 00:05:52,900
by its own fruit.

80
00:05:53,620 --> 00:05:55,920
For figs are not gathered from thorn bushes,

81
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,900
nor are grapes picked from

82
00:05:57,900 --> 00:05:58,820
a bramble bush.

83
00:05:59,840 --> 00:06:01,640
The good person out of the good treasure

84
00:06:01,640 --> 00:06:03,360
of his heart produces good,

85
00:06:03,780 --> 00:06:05,800
and the evil person out of his

86
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:07,680
evil treasure produces evil.

87
00:06:08,320 --> 00:06:09,660
For out of the abundance

88
00:06:09,660 --> 00:06:11,740
of the heart his mouth speaks.

89
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:13,520
Why

90
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:15,720
do you call me, Lord, Lord,

91
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:17,580
and not do what I tell you?

92
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,780
Everyone who comes to me and

93
00:06:19,780 --> 00:06:21,300
hears my words and does them,

94
00:06:21,660 --> 00:06:23,480
I will show you what he is like.

95
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:25,800
He is like a man building

96
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,600
a house, who dug deep

97
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:29,600
and laid the foundation on the rock,

98
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:31,960
and when a flood arose, the stream

99
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:33,820
broke against that house and could not

100
00:06:33,820 --> 00:06:35,840
shake it, because it had been well

101
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:37,840
built. But the one who

102
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:39,540
hears and does not do them

103
00:06:39,540 --> 00:06:41,860
is like a man who built a house on

104
00:06:41,860 --> 00:06:43,340
the ground without a foundation.

105
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:46,040
When the stream broke against it, immediately

106
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,880
it fell, and the ruin of

107
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:49,360
that house was great.

